<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>SCNF 2026 · Kyoto afternoon guide</name><Placemark><name>0 · Heian Jingu Kaikan</name><description>Dinner venue
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: Reference point
Dinner venue: Heian Jingu Kaikan (平安神宮会館), beside the shrine. Final meeting time and event arrangements will be announced separately.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>0</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>0 · Heian Jingu Kaikan</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.0152411</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.7841311</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Dinner venue</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>Reference point</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>Dinner venue: Heian Jingu Kaikan (平安神宮会館), beside the shrine. Final meeting time and event arrangements will be announced separately.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.7841311,35.0152411,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-dinner-venue</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>1 · Kyoto Handicraft Center</name><description>Crafts and shopping
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~0.6 km; 9–12 min
Browse Japanese crafts and gifts. March–December 10:00–19:00. Workshops are separately booked.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>1</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>1 · Kyoto Handicraft Center</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.0175601</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.7802525</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Crafts and shopping</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~0.6 km; 9–12 min</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>Browse Japanese crafts and gifts. March–December 10:00–19:00. Workshops are separately booked.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.7802525,35.0175601,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-crafts-and-shopping</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>2 · KYOTO ROKURO</name><description>Cafes
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~150 m; 3–5 min
Japanese tea and an antique gallery near Heian Jingu. 10:00–18:00; last order 17:30. Closed Tuesdays and Wednesdays.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>2</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>2 · KYOTO ROKURO</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.015754087871</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.78484506045</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Cafes</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~150 m; 3–5 min</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>Japanese tea and an antique gallery near Heian Jingu. 10:00–18:00; last order 17:30. Closed Tuesdays and Wednesdays.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.78484506045,35.015754087871,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-cafes</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>3 · Okazaki Shrine</name><description>Temples and shrines
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: Northeast of Heian Jingu; short stop
Rabbit statues and a small, quiet shrine precinct. A short outdoor stop northeast of Heian Jingu. Visit in daylight and follow local access notices.
Shrine identity and rabbit statues checked against the official website, 6 November 2026. No fixed visiting hours are asserted.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>3</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>3 · Okazaki Shrine</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.0173671</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.7887934</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Temples and shrines</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>Northeast of Heian Jingu; short stop</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>Rabbit statues and a small, quiet shrine precinct. A short outdoor stop northeast of Heian Jingu. Visit in daylight and follow local access notices.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.7887934,35.0173671,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-temples-and-shrines</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>4 · 58DINER</name><description>Beer and sake
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~0.6 km; 8–11 min
A casual diner with craft beer, sweets and food. Open from 11:00; closed Mondays. Official pages differ on evening closing time; check the current shop information.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>4</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>4 · 58DINER</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.013797</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.779095</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Beer and sake</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~0.6 km; 8–11 min</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>A casual diner with craft beer, sweets and food. Open from 11:00; closed Mondays. Official pages differ on evening closing time; check the current shop information.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.779095,35.013797,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-beer-and-sake</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>5 · Tsutaya Books / Modern Terrace / Starbucks</name><description>Books and cafes
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~0.4 km; 5–7 min
Books 10:00–20:00; Modern Terrace 11:00–22:00 serves coffee, Kyoto craft beer and sake (drink orders until 21:00); Starbucks 08:00–22:00 with irregular holidays. Same Park Plaza building.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>5</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>5 · Tsutaya Books / Modern Terrace / Starbucks</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.0138732</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.7814175</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Books and cafes</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~0.4 km; 5–7 min</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>Books 10:00–20:00; Modern Terrace 11:00–22:00 serves coffee, Kyoto craft beer and sake (drink orders until 21:00); Starbucks 08:00–22:00 with irregular holidays. Same Park Plaza building.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.7814175,35.0138732,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-books-and-cafes</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>6 · Kyoto Museum of Crafts and Design / Miyakomesse</name><description>Crafts indoors
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~0.5 km; 6–9 min + indoors
Indoor crafts museum on B1 of Miyakomesse. Open 10:00–18:00; museum admission until 17:30. Building arrival reference on the north side; allow time to reach B1. Adult admission JPY500.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.
Outdoor/indoor access wording checked 6 November 2026.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>6</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>6 · Kyoto Museum of Crafts and Design / Miyakomesse</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.0135045</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.7806502</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Crafts indoors</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~0.5 km; 6–9 min + indoors</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>Indoor crafts museum on B1 of Miyakomesse. Open 10:00–18:00; museum admission until 17:30. Building arrival reference on the north side; allow time to reach B1. Adult admission JPY500.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.7806502,35.0135045,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-crafts-indoors</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>7 · KYOCERA Museum / ENFUSE</name><description>Art and cafes
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~0.4 km; 6–8 min
Museum galleries: 10:00–18:00, last admission 17:30. ENFUSE cafe has separate hours: 10:30–19:00, last orders 18:00.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.
Outdoor/indoor access wording checked 6 November 2026.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>7</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>7 · KYOCERA Museum / ENFUSE</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.012839</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.78357</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Art and cafes</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~0.4 km; 6–8 min</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>Museum galleries: 10:00–18:00, last admission 17:30. ENFUSE cafe has separate hours: 10:30–19:00, last orders 18:00.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.78357,35.012839,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-art-and-cafes</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>8 · Keiryu Bridge / Okazaki Canal</name><description>Walks
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~0.5 km; 7–9 min
Waterside walk and views of the great torii. Use public paths.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>8</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>8 · Keiryu Bridge / Okazaki Canal</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.0120273</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.7827262</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Walks</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~0.5 km; 7–9 min</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>Waterside walk and views of the great torii. Use public paths.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.7827262,35.0120273,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-walks</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>9 · Lake Biwa Canal Museum</name><description>History
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~0.8 km; 11–13 min
Indoor canal museum: 09:00–17:00, last admission 16:30. The nearby canal walks are separate outdoor stops.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.
Outdoor/indoor access wording checked 6 November 2026.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>9</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>9 · Lake Biwa Canal Museum</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.0119463</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.7882391</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>History</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~0.8 km; 11–13 min</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>Indoor canal museum: 09:00–17:00, last admission 16:30. The nearby canal walks are separate outdoor stops.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.7882391,35.0119463,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-history</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>10 · Keage Incline / lower end</name><description>Walks
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~0.7 km; 10–13 min
Arrival point at the northern lower end of the former boat railway. The full slope takes extra time. Visit while light and follow access notices.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>10</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>10 · Keage Incline / lower end</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.0114669</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.7881774</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Walks</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~0.7 km; 10–13 min</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>Arrival point at the northern lower end of the former boat railway. The full slope takes extra time. Visit while light and follow access notices.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.7881774,35.0114669,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-walks</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>11 · Blue Bottle Coffee Kyoto Cafe</name><description>Cafes
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~0.9 km; 12–15 min
A seated coffee break near Nanzen-ji; 44 seats. Open daily 08:00–18:00. This is the main cafe, not the reservation-only Lounge.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>11</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>11 · Blue Bottle Coffee Kyoto Cafe</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.0113644</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.7894737</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Cafes</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~0.9 km; 12–15 min</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>A seated coffee break near Nanzen-ji; 44 seats. Open daily 08:00–18:00. This is the main cafe, not the reservation-only Lounge.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.7894737,35.0113644,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-cafes</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>12 · Nanzen-ji Sanmon area</name><description>Temple approaches
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~1.2 km; 16–20 min
Free outdoor grounds: see the Sanmon gate exterior and continue to the Suirokaku aqueduct. Paid visits only: last admission 16:10, close 16:30 in December. Distance is to Sanmon; the aqueduct is a further walk. Visit while light and follow local access notices.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.
Outdoor/indoor access wording checked 6 November 2026.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>12</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>12 · Nanzen-ji Sanmon area</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.0111136</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.7925121</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Temple approaches</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~1.2 km; 16–20 min</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>Free outdoor grounds: see the Sanmon gate exterior and continue to the Suirokaku aqueduct. Paid visits only: last admission 16:10, close 16:30 in December. Distance is to Sanmon; the aqueduct is a further walk. Visit while light and follow local access notices.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.7925121,35.0111136,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-temple-approaches</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>13 · Furukawacho Arcade / BEER Komachi</name><description>Shopping and pub
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~1.1 km; 15–18 min
Walk through the shopping arcade; individual shops have their own hours. BEER Komachi opens 17:00 on weekdays; a pub visit is better after dinner.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.
Outdoor/indoor access wording checked 6 November 2026.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>13</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>13 · Furukawacho Arcade / BEER Komachi</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.0090647</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.7789786</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Shopping and pub</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~1.1 km; 15–18 min</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>Walk through the shopping arcade; individual shops have their own hours. BEER Komachi opens 17:00 on weekdays; a pub visit is better after dinner.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.7789786,35.0090647,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-shopping-and-pub</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>14 · Shirakawa / Ipponbashi bridge</name><description>Walks
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~1.3 km; 18–22 min
A small stone bridge, willows and riverside streets. Enjoy the view without needing to cross the narrow bridge.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>14</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>14 · Shirakawa / Ipponbashi bridge</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.007111</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.7786745</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Walks</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~1.3 km; 18–22 min</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>A small stone bridge, willows and riverside streets. Enjoy the view without needing to cross the narrow bridge.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.7786745,35.007111,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-walks</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>15 · Chion-in Sanmon gate front</name><description>Temple approaches
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~1.3 km; 18–22 min
See the Sanmon exterior from the public approach outside the temple gates. This stop does not require entering the grounds. Temple gates close 16:00 per the Japanese guide; the Sanmon interior is not normally open.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.
Outdoor/indoor access wording checked 6 November 2026.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>15</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>15 · Chion-in Sanmon gate front</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.0047902</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.7814897</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Temple approaches</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~1.3 km; 18–22 min</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>See the Sanmon exterior from the public approach outside the temple gates. This stop does not require entering the grounds. Temple gates close 16:00 per the Japanese guide; the Sanmon interior is not normally open.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.7814897,35.0047902,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-temple-approaches</styleUrl></Placemark><Placemark><name>16 · Gion Yamaneko Kyoto Sake &amp; Beer</name><description>Beer and sake
Walk from Heian Jingu Kaikan: ~1.7 km; 23–28 min
Kyoto sake and craft beer in Gion. Usual hours 13:00–23:00; last order 22:30. A longer walk or after-dinner option; allow time to return.
Hours checked 4–5 November 2026; routes and distances are approximate. © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS.</description><ExtendedData><Data name="Number"><value>16</value></Data><Data name="Name"><value>16 · Gion Yamaneko Kyoto Sake &amp; Beer</value></Data><Data name="Latitude"><value>35.004892</value></Data><Data name="Longitude"><value>135.7771854</value></Data><Data name="Category"><value>Beer and sake</value></Data><Data name="Walk from dinner venue"><value>~1.7 km; 23–28 min</value></Data><Data name="Notes"><value>Kyoto sake and craft beer in Gion. Usual hours 13:00–23:00; last order 22:30. A longer walk or after-dinner option; allow time to return.</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>135.7771854,35.004892,0</coordinates></Point><styleUrl>#point-beer-and-sake</styleUrl></Placemark><Style id="walk-A"><LineStyle><color>ff7b7f00</color><width>4</width></LineStyle></Style><Placemark><name>A · Canal and books walk</name><styleUrl>#walk-A</styleUrl><description>Suggested walking segment, not a complete afternoon itinerary. Approx. 0.8 km; walking network estimate excluding stops. Source: © OpenStreetMap contributors / FOSSGIS. Follow local signs; not turn-by-turn navigation.</description><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>135.784137,35.015076,0 135.782663,35.015041,0 135.782498,35.01504,0 135.782501,35.014994,0 135.782506,35.014924,0 135.782507,35.014916,0 135.782507,35.014906,0 135.782517,35.014763,0 135.782521,35.014719,0 135.78253,35.01458,0 135.782534,35.014534,0 135.782552,35.014275,0 135.782556,35.014222,0 135.782566,35.014084,0 135.782567,35.014061,0 135.782586,35.013805,0 135.782587,35.013784,0 135.782433,35.013774,0 135.782434,35.013723,0 135.782435,35.013705,0 135.782436,35.013649,0 135.782436,35.013567,0 135.782438,35.013535,0 135.782438,35.0135,0 135.782457,35.013272,0 135.782462,35.013208,0 135.782466,35.013163,0 135.782469,35.01312,0 135.782473,35.013076,0 135.782477,35.013016,0 135.78248,35.012987,0 135.782488,35.01289